Properties.Value:
{%- comment -%}
  Every active member of the worker group. No schedule check, no filtering.

  securityenabled:'false' is REQUIRED. A webhook-launched workflow has no
  logged-in person, and entity commands apply Rock's entity security, so
  without it this returns NOTHING - silently, with no error.

  REQUIRES Enabled Lava Commands: RockEntity
